BT
/F1 10 Tf
14. TL
0.118 0.157 0.196 rg
70.8661417322834666 728.5041732283464171 Td
(The Himalayan region, often referred to as the "Water Tower of Asia," is experiencing a severe crisis) Tj
T* (both in glacial-fed and non-glacial rainfed river watersheds. Rainfed rivers in Uttarakhand play a vital) Tj
T* (role in supporting agriculture, industry, and human consumption, having over 353 significant rainfed) Tj
T* (rivers of fourth order and above spanning 5,796 km. Within the watersheds of these rainfed rivers,) Tj
T* (about 70% of villages and more than 80% of urban centers of Uttarakhand are located.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Due to anthropogenically and technogenically accelerated climate change impacts, traditional water) Tj
T* (sources such as natural springs and naulas are steadily transforming from their perennial nature to) Tj
T* (ephemeral nature, causing major rivers to dwindle rapidly due to decrease in base flow during summer) Tj
T* (seasons. Failing to take planned scientific action for groundwater augmentation through massive) Tj
T* (rainwater harvesting mechanical and biological measures in the recharge areas will lead to dire) Tj
T* (consequences, including severe drinking water scarcity, biodiversity loss, and exacerbated climate) Tj
T* (change impacts.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (This report formulates a scientific integrated strategy for rejuvenation of springs, streams, and rivers) Tj
T* (using the Dhargad River watershed in Bageshwar district as a natural laboratory.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Fundamental Objectives:) Tj
T* (1. Identify and prioritize dead and dying naulas, springs, and streams in the watershed.) Tj
T* (2. Assess the status of water sources and delineate potential hydro-geomorphic recharge zones.) Tj
T* (3. Develop a GIScience-based Decision Support System \(DSS\) for rejuvenation planning.) Tj
T* (4. Implement and monitor micro-plans in active association with local inhabitants and Gram) Tj
T* (Panchayats.) Tj
T* (5. Mitigate the adverse impacts of climate change on hydrology and mountain livelihoods.) Tj
ET
endstream
